laurel mu 0001: laurel_sproutPkg boots UniXNU/DarwinBoot like negroniPkg (iOSPlus10 laurel-sprout, 2026-11-01).
Applied to external/Mu-Silicium-negroni by scripts/laurel/mu-build.sh (git apply; the tree is reset first).
- dsc/fdf/DXE.inc: UniXNU boot manager app + UniXNUDxe (Boot#### "unixnu:firmware"), DarwinBoot (XNU loader),
  negroniPkg's NegroniBootMemoryDxe (publishes the ABL ramdisk = our payload FAT as a read-only block device from
  /chosen linux,initrd-start/end of the live FDT; adds the DT memory banks' holes as system memory, 1 GiB max).
- MemoryMapLib: "Kernel RAM" 0x80000000 + 0x40000000 conventional: the DarwinBoot window (ADT darwinboot-memory-size,
  768 MiB) lands at the first conventional run that fits = 0x80000000 + (kernel VA & 0x1FFFFFF); the shim boots ran
  XNU in the same 1 GiB (mkadt --dram 0x80000000:0x40000000).
- DeviceBuild.py: PackagesPath gets UniXNU/package, UniXNU/drivers/DarwinBoot (UNIXNU_ROOT) and Platforms/OnePlus.
- PcdDebugPropertyMask 0x0F: DarwinBoot's DEBUG_ERROR hand-off facts reach the screen log.
